{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117700","id":3428183810,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7MVe8C","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117700","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117700.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117700.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117700","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117700/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117700/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117700/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/be7b5020c68b4aaa05f239969e670ad462b0382d","number":117700,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Refactor `EditorToaster`, adding a `EditorToast` class and `Actions`","user":{"login":"jaydensipe","id":47132280,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MTMyMjgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47132280?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe","html_url":"https://github.com/jaydensipe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/14510.\r\nCloses https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/8155 (_a Copy button was implemented in the past_).\r\nCloses https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/57488 _(Clear All button idea from @snailrhymer)_.\r\nCloses https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/8157 _(implemented as a Clear All button)_.\r\n\r\nThis PR refactors the `EditorToaster` internals by introducing a `EditorToast` class that can be returned by `push_toast()`. This allows us to then specify `Actions` that can be attached to this toast notification.\r\n\r\nThese `Actions` are essentially buttons that can be assigned a Callable, which then allows you to implement a function call to do various things.\r\n\r\nThis PR also adds a `Clear All` button as a nicety to the notification menu.\r\n\r\n--\r\n- [x] Write Documentation (_waiting on implementation approval_).\r\n- [x] API: instant_close or close(instant: bool)?\r\n- [ ] API: Require manual close on Callable press or not?\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/caf6cdae-804a-4192-bf65-ae27bf121bc8\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Old Video for Reference</summary>\r\n<video src=https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/84c97596-a6c8-4177-a00a-5a9c89d4b146></video>\r\n</details>","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","description":"","color":"447744","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":